{"path":"io/basic_ios/narrow","title":"std::basic_ios<CharT,Traits>::narrow","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ios&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>narrow","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/narrow","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Converts a current locale-specific character c to its standard equivalent. The result is converted from char_type to char if needed.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char</span> narrow<span class=\"br0\">(</span> char_type c, <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> dfault <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Converts a current locale-specific character <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c</span></code> to its standard equivalent. The result is converted from <code>char_type</code> to <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span> if needed. If no conversion can be performed, the function returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dfault</span></code>.\n</p><p>Effectively calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/use_facet\"><span class=\"kw1914\">std::<span class=\"me2\">use_facet</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype\"><span class=\"kw1955\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ctype</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>char_type<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>getloc<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">narrow</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c, dfault<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> c\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> character to convert\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> dfault\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> character to return if the conversion was unsuccessful\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Character converted to its standard equivalent and then to <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span>. <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dfault</span></code> is returned if the conversion fails.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/widen\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>widen</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  widens characters <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype/narrow\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>narrow</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  invokes <code>do_narrow</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::ctype&lt;CharT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/multibyte/wctob\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wctob</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  narrows a wide character to a single-byte narrow character, if possible <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_ios","title":"std::basic_ios"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_ios<CharT,Traits>::narrow","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Converts a current locale-specific character c to its standard equivalent."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"c, dfault"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Character converted to its standard equivalent and then to char. dfault is returned if the conversion fails."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"widen","note":"widens characters"},{"label":"narrow","note":"invokes do_narrow"},{"label":"wctob","note":"narrows a wide character to a single-byte narrow character, if possible"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":108,"codeBlockCount":0}
